--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material bundled with this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

assets/idf/baseline_model_atlanta.idf
    Derived from the U.S. Department of Energy commercial reference building
    models / OpenStudio small-office prototype models, which are in the public
    domain.  See:
      Deru et al. (2011), "U.S. Department of Energy Commercial Reference
      Building Models of the National Building Stock", NREL.
      Im, New & Bae (2019), "Updated OpenStudio Small and Medium Office
      Prototype Models", ORNL.

assets/weather/*.epw
    TMY and Actual Meteorological Year weather files for Atlanta
    Hartsfield-Jackson Intl. AP (WMO 722190).  The AMY files were assembled with
    the `diyepw` package from NOAA ISD observations; see scripts/00_download_weather.py.

The accompanying paper (Applied Energy 375 (2024) 124080) is published open
access under CC BY 4.0.  This source-code license does not extend to the text
or figures of the paper.
